job: harness/ledger-per-repo

goal and acceptance criteria
Move the lease ledger to the per-repository state dir.
Done when a row put from one checkout is listed from a second worktree of the same repo.

write paths
  internal/ledger
  cmd/magus/ledger.go

deny paths
  MAGUS.md
  docs/gen

graph evidence
  internal/ledger -> dir:internal/ledger, blast radius 4

the only check you run
magus run test internal/ledger

